                        ],
                        "form": "latents"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "bd900545-13da-44cc-a31c-f5bf75550133",
                        "entry_id": "990357e4-7278-31d2-9899-fd0eb6873582",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "latente"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f8c18918-3508-42ad-8bb8-207126ed11a3",
                        "entry_id": "990357e4-7278-31d2-9899-fd0eb6873582",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "latentes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b43ad61a-50da-34a5-94b0-79fc7bfc0e0a",
                        "entry_id": "990357e4-7278-31d2-9899-fd0eb6873582",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Non apparent, qui ne se manifeste pas, sous-jacent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cedea966-c4f0-43c3-a311-3bb12539e680",
                                "sense_id": "b43ad61a-50da-34a5-94b0-79fc7bfc0e0a",
                                "text": "Ne peut-on pas admettre […], que les êtres exceptionnels qui apparaissent de loin en loin dans une famille, ne sont que le fait de l’éclosion spontanée de qualités supérieures restées latentes chez leurs prédécesseurs ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dae7b41-b6cd-4697-bd1a-8802402cfe9f",
                                "sense_id": "b43ad61a-50da-34a5-94b0-79fc7bfc0e0a",
                                "text": "Laissez-la [la branche] intacte si elle n’est pas trop longue, sinon taillez au-dessus de 5 à 6 groupes de fleurs. À la base, le repercement d’un œil latent est possible, ce qui assurera le remplacement de la chiffonne."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "260ea83b-9523-3c92-aab1-94aec81ce42b",
                        "entry_id": "990357e4-7278-31d2-9899-fd0eb6873582",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caché."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7169ca44-f678-4348-9a31-58ea3f44dce3",
                                "sense_id": "260ea83b-9523-3c92-aab1-94aec81ce42b",
                                "text": "À en croire les informations de presse les plus fraîches, un compromis semble se dessiner sur un programme moins ambitieux, mais financé, au moins en partie, par une mesure fiscale plutôt inédite, et très populaire auprès des économistes progressistes: la taxation des plus-values dites « latentes ».\n […].\nEn clair, il s’agirait de taxer les gains dormant dans les épais portefeuilles d’actions des grandes fortunes américaines, après une période particulièrement faste sur les marchés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0720b21a-8bb8-4863-b31c-41ddd92a811e",
                                "sense_id": "260ea83b-9523-3c92-aab1-94aec81ce42b",
                                "text": "va jusqu’à l’innommé le vétuste l’insoupçonné – il gît latent au fond des profondeurs attend d’être cueilli comme on le dirait d’une fleur oubliée d’une pierre qui ne sait plus luire depuis son enfouissement qui ne veut pas quitter le creux des boues – nettoie la source du limon"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28885e5d-82f3-49d3-b506-b377d111080b",
                        "source_entry_id": "990357e4-7278-31d2-9899-fd0eb6873582",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui n’est pas apparent ; sous-jacent",
                        "target_lang_word": "latent",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "latent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63a3f3f2-bce1-3aa0-a69f-f8da625ec746",
                                        "entry_id": "627eb6b5-ac71-3da3-90b8-472eb82b0ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Existing or present but concealed or inactive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17943c7b-95e5-4165-b137-277ad0bf0c09",
                                                "sense_id": "63a3f3f2-bce1-3aa0-a69f-f8da625ec746",
                                                "text": "There is known latent demand for rail freight and the rail freight industry is working with Scottish businesses to develop new rail freight services, as environmental concerns are beginning to change the logistics choices of Scottish producers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1056865c-d2b5-30e8-a37b-fb487d763774",
                                        "entry_id": "627eb6b5-ac71-3da3-90b8-472eb82b0ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remaining in an inactive or hidden phase; dormant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b3c0e4-1bdd-44cd-9c3c-68355971209e",
                                                "sense_id": "1056865c-d2b5-30e8-a37b-fb487d763774",
                                                "text": "2008 July 2, Joe Palca, “Scientists Make Herpes Breakthrough”, abstract, All Things Considered, National Public Radio\nThose infected with a herpes virus are infected for life. That’s because the virus goes \"latent.\" Sometimes, it awakes from its slumber, producing painful illnesses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f34e4fa-089a-3f1a-b4c2-27def3133c1b",
                                        "entry_id": "627eb6b5-ac71-3da3-90b8-472eb82b0ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lying dormant or hidden until circumstances are suitable for development or manifestation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "latent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8be210e6-9f98-37dc-9972-e9b9e0f0425e",
                                        "entry_id": "04593730-55b5-3c72-b099-a554eeb8270d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The residue left by a person's finger that can be made visible by a process such as powder dusting; a latent fingerprint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb53d888-66b7-43c4-af20-3817ea91ad22",
                                                "sense_id": "8be210e6-9f98-37dc-9972-e9b9e0f0425e",
                                                "text": "Once the latent prints have been visualized by the superglue and powder dusting techniques, they should be photographed again. Then the developed latents need to be lifted and placed on backing cards. The latent cards are documented by putting the case number, date and time of lifting, initials of person processing the evidence, and a sketch indicating the location of the lifted latent print on the back of the lift card, as shown in Photo 6.6."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b71bcf00-6209-4780-9d05-45c00cec59fe",
                                                "sense_id": "8be210e6-9f98-37dc-9972-e9b9e0f0425e",
                                                "text": "Paralegal workers do not argue cases in court, and these crimescene fingerprint gatherers do not compare crime-scene latents to known prints of suspects and present their findings in court."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                        "entry_id": "04593730-55b5-3c72-b099-a554eeb8270d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An underlying cause that can be inferred from statistical correlations; factor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2f64714-600e-406b-b7a9-5bb273af9d89",
                                                "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                                "text": "These kinds of latents define the invariant dispositional properties enabling prediction and control of the external environment. Finally, there are the latents that underlie manifestation as relationships of power, as cause to effect, condition to occurrence, or dependent variable to independent variable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ccc25a2-dec3-4ce5-b3eb-2d94d783c9b6",
                                                "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                                "text": "That is, the observed covariance between indicator y₁ and y₃ would mirror the understandable causal behavior of the corresponding underlying latents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91b0902e-87e1-429c-8194-4fe032d0d3c3",
                                                "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                                "text": "If one were to compute the reproduced covariances among the latents of the structural model, they might be different from the covariances obtained between the same number of latents in the measurement model."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d460381-a0dc-3960-82b7-762f86ad6f0c",
                                        "entry_id": "04593730-55b5-3c72-b099-a554eeb8270d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that is latent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86386308-df80-4bd5-8e25-81d603950031",
                                                "sense_id": "0d460381-a0dc-3960-82b7-762f86ad6f0c",
                                                "text": "Even if latents may not be actually detectable in any given situation, they may nevertheless be present in it. Latents may become actual if proper triggering conditions are in place, or they may be lost in the process."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5d8ccb5-18a0-477f-b6c5-2254cf2be3a5",
                                                "sense_id": "0d460381-a0dc-3960-82b7-762f86ad6f0c",
                                                "text": "After we discovered Leah and I realized what she was, the flood gates opened. More and more latents have been discovered, as well as cubs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
